@startuml
title UML state machine diagram

state Initial
Initial : entry / User logs in

[*] --> Initial

state ServiceCenterHome
ServiceCenterHome : entry / Display home page
ServiceCenterHome : do / Display journey details upon user login and destination selection
ServiceCenterHome : exit / Enter Damaged parts list [user chooses to repair vehicle]
ServiceCenterHome : exit / Expiry Notification page [expiry notification is available]
ServiceCenterHome : exit / Updating Information list [information needs updating]
ServiceCenterHome --> ServiceCenterHome_Repair
ServiceCenterHome --> ServiceCenterHome_Expiry
ServiceCenterHome --> ServiceCenterHome_UpdateInfo

state ServiceCenterHome_Repair
ServiceCenterHome_Repair : entry / Enter Damaged parts list
ServiceCenterHome_Repair : do / Preparing and entering damaged parts list
ServiceCenterHome_Repair : exit / Return to service center home page
ServiceCenterHome --> ServiceCenterHome_Repair

state ServiceCenterHome_Expiry
ServiceCenterHome_Expiry : entry / To view expiry notification
ServiceCenterHome_Expiry : do / Send service request to Car owner
ServiceCenterHome_Expiry : exit / Return to Service center home page
ServiceCenterHome --> ServiceCenterHome_Expiry

state ServiceCenterHome_UpdateInfo
ServiceCenterHome_UpdateInfo : entry / To update changed parts information
ServiceCenterHome_UpdateInfo : do / Update Information
ServiceCenterHome_UpdateInfo : exit / Return to Service center home page
ServiceCenterHome --> ServiceCenterHome_UpdateInfo

state DrivingMode
DrivingMode : entry / Activate driving mode or choose other options after viewing journey details
DrivingMode : do / Enable users to select a place to eat, view its menu, and place an order if they are hungry
DrivingMode : exit / Continue with driving mode
ServiceCenterHome --> DrivingMode

state Accident
Accident : entry / Inform relevant authorities in the event of an accident
Accident : do / Send notifications during driving or in case of an accident
Accident : exit / Return to Service center home page
DrivingMode --> Accident

state Feedback
Feedback : entry / Upon completion of their journey
Feedback : do / Allow users to provide feedback
Feedback : exit / Feedback submitted successfully
DrivingMode --> Feedback

state Logout
Logout : entry / To Logout
Logout : do / Logout
Logout : exit / Logged out Successfully
ServiceCenterHome --> Logout
@enduml
